Conventions and Principles

Naming Conventions: Branch name mainn / atta hai aur worktree name mainn - atta hai , branch name: hotfix/typo and worktree name: hotfix-typo

Keep branch and working tree name same

Worktree is a folder.
Main cheez hai repository [Repo].
Branch aiik pointer hoti hai towards a commit.
All Branches belong to the Repo.
.git folder is git database. It is not recreated for the worktree.
Branch mainn kamm karnay kay liye checkout karna hai.

Principle 1: Repo mainn Worktrees hotay hainn. Har worktree mainn aik branch checkout hoti hai.

Principle 2: Aikk worktree mainn aikk time par aikk branch hii checkkout hoo sakti hai. New Checkout in another branchh at the same time kay liye aik ne wwork tree banayein aur uss mainn checkout karein.

git worktree add ../dev dev
specify folder/worktree location and the branch you want to checkout in it

Principle 3: App new worktree bana kar aikk waqt mainn multiple branches par checkkout kar saktay hainn lakin badd mainn unn worktrees koo delete karna hota hai 
git worktree remove ../dev
(delete dev folder/worktree)

Note: Basically voo apki repo kaa clone bana kar uss par checkout karwata hai.


# 1 CREATE
git worktree add -b hotfix/typo ../hotfix-typo main
git worktree list

# 2 SETUP
cp .env ../app-hotfix-typo

# 3 WORK
cd ../hotfix-typo                                      
sed -i 's/Welcom /Welcome /' README.md
git commit -am "fix: README typo"

# 4 MERGE

cd ../app && git merge hotfix/typo

# REMOVE
git worktree remove ../hotfix-typo 
git branch -d hotfix/typo
git status

